omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GCJBZXifEbwQ7kNvwGhw9KQ&_nc_oc=Adqz-hRM8KC-i7qANzEyBWcoRd7krQgJCTw9Ul1DfnUb3daRB_2uRRqVLxHZthHMrEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI5sSuGTOD9GcDfxGLbQop-2Vmr6HFJTQ_v6XNsnk7sCA&oe=6AAAB434"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0chDoKLYQ0Q7kNvwFJQ0pu&_nc_oc=AdrFRlznxl9kwoAFJcrsPsT_TKny6kIQd1iFcVFpXLQON1gB9Fp5D-EqMmZ-xODH670&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXh_4iuOP_NQLXfPJFXuqg5IPhcTTwv0RW68r1bjS4Iw&oe=6AAAB596"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLJXKBT6EJMQ7kNvwETAZNK&_nc_oc=Ado2TsTHUdJGBf4lnzciWarTTRAzAEsDsJFbiZXY8wPlq_dCi3conEdAHT3-SJ__KwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIK-FujiZ1et5_m4b_Zbo68mdh2Q2rtPQ95PTkDqZpOSg&oe=6AAA9277"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://